{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2015-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1450915200, "end_date": 1451606399, "month_true_total": 293, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:10:57 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "20162837", "author": {"steamid": "76561198175203083", "personaname": "LiL WindeX", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198175203083/", "num_games_owned": 119, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 186, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 159, "last_played": 1462645612, "avatar": "a555e4062953ed196b45bab976a5235e3496cd3a"}, "language": "english", "review": "ori spose", "timestamp_created": 1451602643, "timestamp_updated": 1451602643, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49751242995262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20162655", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135709349", "personaname": "Pluto★", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198135709349/", "num_games_owned": 90, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 6595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2512, "last_played": 1551043216, "avatar": "c4a9a9e77855949a259894588b27ad30a567e3d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hardest game I have played in a long time, maybe in my whole life. I want to start with saying one thing, THE SOUND TRACK IS AMAZING. Risk of Rain is a super additcive 2d platformer with a huge amout of different enimies to fight, items to get, characters to unlock and more. I have never hated but loved a game so much. The online multiplayer is pretty broken and using a keyboard is way harder than a controller but it was still a fun experience and I will remember the first time I beat it and the relief I felt for a long time, I think it is well worth the money if you dont rage alot, (even if you dont prepare for table flips (╯°□°）╯︵ ┻━┻).", "timestamp_created": 1451602068, "timestamp_updated": 1451602068, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "20162561", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014179886", "personaname": "Deagaler", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198014179886/", "num_games_owned": 511, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1588, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 839, "last_played": 1687967313, "avatar": "491261620eded355c8339ef332dda3de5804fd54"}, "language": "english", "review": "great rouge like but for best experince play with friends", "timestamp_created": 1451601817, "timestamp_updated": 1451601817, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20157513", "author": {"steamid": "76561198093242263", "personaname": "THE LAG PYRO", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/THELAGPYRO/", "num_games_owned": 918, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 9167, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3750, "last_played": 1697802700, "avatar": "0e2213d7d1dfd4395c27120cf98b3bd09c5d04c4"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10  - would get murder death killed again/\n\n But on a more serious note this game is fantastic  buy it especially if you see that it is on sale you will more than get your money's worth out of it. The game has a great vibe about it, kind of gloomy. The art in it is some of the best art i have seen in games I personally love it. And the music for me is byfar my favorite video game music of all time very retro rockish. Overall the game is fun just run around shoot em up and grab the perks then go to the next level and do it again for as long as you want. Then go beat the boss up and leave. So go ahead and click the add to cart button and enjoy it.", "timestamp_created": 1451588965, "timestamp_updated": 1451588965, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20156495", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075985765", "personaname": "HaberNoDashery", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nesu101/", "num_games_owned": 116, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1399, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 432, "last_played": 1641858506, "avatar": "256ebf8f898530d893d0c8ea61fd5adad81312ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Allow me to say this is one of the most difficult yet entertaining game i have ever played. They amount of work you put into one run can be almost instantly taken away from you for one mistake. It keeps you on your toes, never really sitting around. The multitude of classes and difficulties also complements a variety of playstyles. For this cheap a price on sale and the amount of replayability, its almost a mistake not to at least try the game out.", "timestamp_created": 1451586529, "timestamp_updated": 1461261817, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502487540245056152", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}